# Arathi Highlands (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 10 flagged rares and the fixed world
# containers of Arathi Highlands a Horde player can actually engage. Run it
# in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or standalone. EVERY
# goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route. Spawn
# points and levels are the local Forever game data (questie-forever); the
# data records no loot on any of these ten rares, so there are no signature
# drops to chase. Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are
# stated. Two higher-level rares (Foulbelly, Prince Nazjak) sit just above
# the 30-40 band and carry come-back-later notes. No rare in this guide is
# a giver, ender, or objective of any Horde core-contracted quest. There are
# no item-start hunts to route (the writ 94212 is sourceless; 92707 has no
# start record), and no tame lines ship (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# See docs/arathi-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory.
guide butler-routes-completionist/arathi-horde-rares
title Arathi Highlands (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-40
zone Arathi Highlands
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords arathi, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

