  note The Alliance-only chests elsewhere in the zone are not listed here — a Horde player cannot use them. Trelane's Footlocker, the Messenger Bag and satchel, the Cache of Explosives, the Myzrael shards, Trollbane's Tomb, the Binding stones and the Keystone are all quest-owned and routed in the core guides, not here. Respawn timers unconfirmed.

